Magnetic Resonance (CMR) Imaging.', 'Health;Imaging;Vocabularies', 'OWL', 1, '0.4.5', '2018-11-01T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/CMR-QA', 'e883578187369627da912cbf4ea9b4379489413178ab3ca729c2958b26193428', 'scored', NULL, 9.91, 1.14, 1.14, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 1.57, 9.0, 5.405, 5.405, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1109, 111, 111, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:05:05+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
