If you have any comments, questions or suggestions, please contact Yann Le Franc at ylefranc(at)gmail.com.', 'Vocabularies', 'OWL', 8, 'version 0.5', '2015-11-16T18:21:21.000-08:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/CNO', '28691c15199b5a0e7d53e41de0c334b060c252503fd54b7aecdeea5918d02680', 'scored', NULL, 9.97, 5.79, 5.79, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 0.74, 10.0, 6.625, 6.625, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3185, 387, 387, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:06:52+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
