A set of temporal clinical manifestations are semantically annotated with a domain phenotype ontology and registered with a time-stamped value.', 'Phenotype', 'OWL', 2, 'vtemp2', '2012-03-12T00:00:00.000-07:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/CTX', 'f8cd648b1b10ee4e9da65d928c904a6c5df862fea2a3ad14ee04b8bb74570063', 'scored', NULL, 4.06, 0.57, 0.57, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 5.47, 8.0, 4.525, 4.525, NULL, NULL, NULL, 13797, 1244, 479, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:10:30+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
