Update V0.2: Fixed Leiden University coupling to DBpedia', 'Other', 'SKOS', 2, '0.2', '2023-10-11T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/DSIP2324_DEMO', '378805e8ea8a53251c57f4bf87edae1910dcd77b911db3024a70088232c9b9ea', 'scored', NULL, 9.44, 4.94, 4.94, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 0.0, 0.0, 3.595, 3.595, NULL, NULL, NULL, 146, 18, 17, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:03:49+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
