Title: Developing an Ontology Representing Fall Risk Management Domain Knowledge
Link to the article: https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10916-024-02062-2', 'Other', 'OWL', 19, '09.10', '2023-03-28T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/FRMO', '014d6a485afcab0afc30237b54bfc04f517e871eaf2abc01857ca9006274165b', 'scored', NULL, 9.98, 1.0, 1.0, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 1.24, 10.0, 5.555, 5.555, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6907, 892, 891, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:08:33+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
