sheet2rdf is used to build and serve M4M Vocabulary, while PURL is used to persist identifiers for the vocabulary:

http://purl.org/m4m/', 'Other', 'SKOS', 42, '0.0.5', '2025-09-09T09:08:22.000-07:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/GFF-M4M', 'e7b97290e37fcd675a1dcaac688d7ea20d7ee5751c1e092185a95b07699335fb', 'scored', NULL, 9.98, 0.46, 0.46, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 0.37, 0.0, 2.7025, 2.7025, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3179, 427, 405, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:06:06+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
