The HL7 vocabulary consists of hierarchical Concept Domains, which are categories of like concepts that will be bound to one or more coded elements; code systems, which are the contexts in which concepts are defined; and value sets, which are lists of intended values for a Concept Domain or sub-domain.', 'Health', 'UMLS', 27, '2025_07', '2025-11-03T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/HL7', 'bd8aa9b9f2c1d3462364c9c44c37a39d101ebd0842b08eba8777924bcbbc9aae', 'scored', NULL, 9.99, 5.13, 5.13, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 7.78, 10.0, 8.225, 8.225, NULL, NULL, NULL, 121554, 9118, 9118, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:22:43+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
