ICPC-2 Plus is primarily used in Australia and provides greater specificity for data input than ICPC-2.', 'Health', 'UMLS', 24, 'ICPC2P_2005', '2024-05-06T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/ICPC2P', NULL, 'not_downloadable', '{"errors":["License restrictions on download for ICPC2P"],"status":403}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
