', 'Other', 'OWL', 2, '8-3-2020', '2020-06-05T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/IDO-COVID-19', '7403d65ecc95ec03a434a8bf95acbf27a5a530a5bd583bc9a3746b35d6eb93ef', 'scored', NULL, 10.0, 6.05, 6.05, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 3.02, 10.0, 7.2675, 7.2675, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8461, 489, 486, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:08:02+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
