<p>FDB MedKnowledge encompasses medications approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration, and information on commonly-used over-the-counter and alternative therapy agents such as herbals, nutraceuticals and dietary supplements.</p>', 'Health', 'UMLS', 27, '2025_08_13', '2025-11-03T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/NDDF', NULL, 'not_downloadable', '{"errors":["License restrictions on download for NDDF"],"status":403}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
