http://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pubmed/25160343 (v4.0)', 'Health', 'OWL', 1, '3.0.4', '2015-10-27T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/ONTOLURGENCES', '219e7d2b75d36f8683d7b2cc5a8b013bc87739cca9c4184d41e443a16ae9ac39', 'scored', NULL, 10.0, 0.3, 0.3, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 0.89, 10.0, 5.2975, 5.2975, NULL, NULL, NULL, 95612, 10031, 10031, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:19:45+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
