Examples of OntoTox instantiations can be found in GitHub : https://github.com/TeamHeka/OntoTox
', 'Biomedical_Resources', 'OWL', 1, '1.0', '2021-09-08T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/ONTOTOX', '85da0467ddc150b7275d140f947ca3c504906dc1ac784d0ac10668b0b6db7cac', 'scored', NULL, 10.0, 0.0, 0.0, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 2.88, 7.0, 4.97, 4.97, NULL, NULL, NULL, 108, 16, 16, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', NULL, '2026-09-23T06:03:42+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
