<p>Read Codes are now known as Clinical Terms. Clinical Terms Version 3 (CTV3) has been merged with the Systematized Nomenclature of Medicine – Reference Terminology (SNOMED RT®), resulting in the creation of SNOMED – Clinical Terms (SNOMED CT®). </p>', '', 'UMLS', 24, 'RCD99', '2024-05-06T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/RCD', NULL, 'not_downloadable', '{"errors":["License restrictions on download for RCD"],"status":403}', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
