This ontology contens seven class Each class has the necessary data properties and several object properties which represent relationship between classes', 'Other', 'OWL', 1, '1.0', '2024-04-30T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/SVU_MWS_WSM_F23', '7a33d7dad393e4b4f24b95f15a9d249e4184ed138617937541f16db8105fb7ed', 'scored', NULL, 0.6, 0.0, 0.0, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 7.84, 8.0, 4.11, 4.11, NULL, NULL, NULL, 843, 116, 8, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', NULL, '2026-09-23T06:04:59+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO ontology_scores (provider, acronym, name, description, categories, ontology_language, submission_id, version, released, bioportal_url, file_sha256, status, status_detail, describe_score, define_score, define_bp_score, define_bp_source, connection_score, flat_score, core_average, core_average_bp, logical_consistency_score, structural_dist_score, semantic_dist_score, triple_count, entity_count, class_count, wiseowl_version, core4_version, device, evaluated_at, updated_at) VALUES ('bioportal', 'SWEET', 'Semantic Web for Earth and Environment Technology Ontology', 'The Semantic Web for Earth and Environmental Terminology is a mature foundational ontology that contains over 6000 concepts organized in 200 ontologies represented in OWL. Top level concepts include Representation (math, space, science, time, data), Realm (Ocean, Land Surface, Terrestrial Hydroshere, Atmosphere, etc.), Phenomena (macro-scale ecological and physical), Processes (micro-scale physical, biological, chemical, and mathematical), Human Activities (Decision, Commerce, Jurisdiction, Environmental, Research). Originally developed by NASA Jet Propulsion Labs under Rob Raskin, SWEET is now officially under the governance of the ESIP foundation. ', '', 'OWL', 13, '3.6.0', '2022-07-14T18:16:30.000-07:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/SWEET', '598c5c49ddefe74b75ae1bbbd7686f34e14bc18eb645a04e8da6bd8d28529abb', 'scored', NULL, 9.83, 0.57, 0.57, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 1.25, 10.0, 5.4125, 5.4125, NULL, NULL, NULL, 65530, 12590, 10239, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:17:11+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
