Ontology is unreachable as of 2024, but continues to be available on BioPortal as a retired ontology. ', '', 'OBO', 16, '2018-11-09', '2020-09-04T00:00:00.000+00:00', 'https://bioportal.bioontology.org/ontologies/VARIO', '405a65caa5bf8fe8585c145bda10875e087c07e202c77d55010f9606a68386c8', 'scored', NULL, 9.98, 6.44, 6.44, 'same_as_strict (1.0 result, not re-checked)', 6.81, 10.0, 8.3075, 8.3075, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6922, 496, 496, '0.10.0', 'core4-1.0', 'cuda', '2026-09-23T06:07:59+00:00', '2026-09-23T23:25:10+00:00');
